{"id": 58, "name": "Martis", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/b/b7/Martis_%28Asura_King%29.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/600?cb=20231029212951", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Charge"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["60", "30", "50", "40"], "lanes": ["Jungle", "Exp Lane"], "story": "Persistent and victorious Asura King.", "skills": [{"name": "Asura's Wrath", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f48a1786aeb1572d0309f509ddd0b444.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Each time Martis uses a skill, his Attack Speed will be increased by 30%, 120% maximum. Lasts 4s. He gains (+8*Hero Level) extra Attack at full stacks."}, {"name": "Asura Aura", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dec679229c3d8b5f18144acfc2cda27f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7", "desc": "Martis draws enemies to a fan-shaped area in front of him and deals 350<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+130% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>, slowing them by 40% for 2s."}, {"name": "Mortal Coil", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_910d3e465d051726ab223b215b7cfdb5.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Martis strikes in the target direction three times, each time dealing 225<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit. Enemies hit by the first and third strike are also knocked back. The attack direction can be changed once using the Joystick.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Martis leaps in the target direction, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+150% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in his path and knocking them airborne.\nMartis gains Control Immunity and 60% Damage Reduction when casting this skill."}, {"name": "Decimation", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bbdf118fe86a5279e943a6db86fc4d7a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 36", "desc": "Martis lunges at a designated enemy hero, dealing 700<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+120% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> (deals True Damage if the enemy's HP is below 50%).\nIf the enemy is killed by this skill, Martis can cast the skill again within 10s and gains 100% extra Movement Speed that gradually decays over 5s. Each successive cast also increases the skill's damage by 15% (up to 30%)."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Sky Piercer", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_a80160d168038deb13d7d93ec41c8401.png"}, {"name": "Cursed Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f10a5ab8cc0a4df1b9fddcc7566dad0e.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Guardian Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fc3154808d5848c4b3d28ea921ee58b9.png"}, {"name": "Immortality", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_cc8a7730e6d539ac10d2e0ed91bf2785.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Assassin", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_